{
  "identifier": "bioportal-iev",
  "title": "Event (INOH pathway ontology)",
  "description": {
    "en": "A structured controlled vocabulary of pathway centric biological processes. This ontology is a INOH pathway annotation ontology, one of a set of ontologies intended to be used in pathway data annotation to ease data integration. This ontology is used to annotate biological processes, pathways, sub-pathways in the INOH pathway data.<br>INOH is part of the BioPAX working group."
